@startuml

participant Service as service
participant Domain as domain
participant Repository as repo
participant Data as data
participant GracenoteService as gracenote
participant AudioDevice as audio_device

service -> domain: start song recognition
domain -> repo: start song recognition
repo -> data: start song recognition
data -> gracenote: register song info callback
gracenote ->data: update status RUNNING
data -> audio_device: configure audio device

loop recognition ongoing
    data -> audio_device: read audio data
    audio_device -> data: audio data
    data -> gracenote: write audio data

    opt new song/silence recognized
        gracenote --> data: song recognized
        data --> repo:  song info
        repo --> domain:  song info
        domain --> service: song info
     end

end

@enduml
